<title>FINLAND: Finnish markka ends 1996 on firm note, seen easing.</title>
<headline>Finnish markka ends 1996 on firm note, seen easing.</headline>
<text>
<p>1410/1210 GMT - The Finnish markka ended 1996 on a firm note. Forex dealers attributed the mild strengthening to end-year position squaring in thin trade.</p>
<p>Next year, they said the markka was likely to begin trading in a range of 2.98-3.00 per mark, but later weaken. The markka could ease to 3.03-3.05 per mark, said dealers at two big banks.</p>
<p>--------------------- 1410 vs 1615 Friday ----------------------</p>
<p> *DEM/FIM 2.9860 vs 2.9880	 *USD/FIM 4.6242 vs 4.6527</p>
<p> *SEK/FIM 0.6718 vs 0.6762	 *ECU index 100.08 vs 100.14</p>
<p>--Peter Starck, Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
